{
  "slug": "claude-cognis",
  "name": "Claude Cognis",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent memory for Claude Code powered by Cognis. Automatically loads relevant context at the start of every session and saves session summaries when you stop — so Claude remembers what you've been working on across sessions. Supports personal memory (private to you) and team memory (shared across your repo). Includes semantic search, codebase indexing, and smart context assembly via MCP tools, skills, and hooks.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **5 commands**, **3 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `cognis-save` (Save important information, architectural decisions, patterns, or project knowledge to Cognis persistent memory), `cognis-search` (Search your memory for past work, previous sessions, architectural decisions, and team knowledge stored in Cognis)\n- **Commands** (5): `index` (Index the current codebase and save a summary to Cognis memory for future reference), `logout` (Remove stored Cognis API credentials from global settings), `memory-stats` (Show memory statistics — total stored memories, session history, and storage breakdown), `project-config` (Configure Cognis settings for the current project (.claude/.cognis-claude/config.json)), `recall` (Recall context from your last session to pick up where you left off)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `Stop`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `cognis`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-cognis@claude-community` from `Lyzr-Cognis/claude-cognis`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 3,
    "command": 5,
    "mcp": 1
  },
